function b = beta01(x);b  = x.^4 .* (35 - 84.*x + 70 .* x.^2 - 20 .* x.^3);% Written by Maureen Clerc and Jerome Kalifa, 1997% clerc@cmapx.polytechnique.fr, kalifa@cmapx.polytechnique.fr        %   % Part of WaveLab Version 802% Built Sunday, October 3, 1999 8:52:27 AM% This is Copyrighted Material% For Copying permissions see COPYING.m% Comments? e-mail wavelab@stat.stanford.edu%       